},
{
["text"] = "The Beep sound when the aura appears is in the Actions tab under show in respective group\n\nSame with Unitframe Glow for @UNITNAME this will add glow at that raidframe\n\nThe icon glow setting is under display for the Icons Group\n\n",
["type"] = "description",
