{
["type"] = "description",
["fontSize"] = "medium",
["text"] = "You can have text replacement from the properties of the timer with {PROPERTYNAME} and a priority from left to right with colon {spellName:name} and check for the first none empty. Check the WAGO page for more information\n\n|cFF33FF00TTS is following the Ingame Option for Text-To-Speech\nTo change few settings read bellow|r\n\nYou can set the volume of the TTS with following command\n/run C_TTSSettings.SetSpeechVolume(n)\nWhere default n is 100 and goes from 0-100 on volume.\n\nYou can also set the TTS speech speed with following in chat\n/run C_TTSSettings.SetSpeechRate(n)\nWhere default n is 0 and negative is slower and higher is faster\n\nAnd select voice with\n/run C_TTSSettings.SetVoiceOption(0, voiceID)\nWhere voiceID is from 0 ... X depending on your installed TTS voices           \n",
